# Coffee Shop Sales Analysis Dashboard

## Tools
Power BI, MySQL, SQL, DAX

## Project Overview
Developed an end-to-end sales analysis dashboard to analyze coffee shop sales performance using data sourced from MySQL.

## Key Responsibilities
- Performed data cleaning, transformation, and aggregation using SQL queries.
- Built a Power BI dashboard with interactive visuals and filters.
- Created DAX measures for Total Sales, Total Orders, and Quantity Sold.
- Analyzed sales trends across time periods, store locations, and product categories.
- Delivered insights to support data-driven business decisions.

## Files Included
- CoffeeShop.sql – SQL queries for data cleaning and analysis
- CoffeeShopDashboard.pbix – Power BI dashboard file
- Coffee Shop Sales.csv – Dataset used for analysis
